{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Mito, a physics-based sandbox adventure game where you explore a procedurally generated world to gather eight keys and defeat an ancient evil. Acquire items, learn skills and prepare yourself for a historic battle. Try the demo today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/4fb91884a66ed09914011064245e4f49.poster.avif?t=1773881789\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/4fb91884a66ed09914011064245e4f49.webm?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/4fb91884a66ed09914011064245e4f49.mp4?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A WORLD OF PHYSICS\u00a0</strong> <br>In Mito, every item is simulated! Things are not just tiles in a grid; they roll and tumble.  <br>Use this against enemies, to traverse the world or to transport materials to build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/3fcd98fc988cfa6d7984c2b8601b0bb0.poster.avif?t=1773881789\" width=1080 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/3fcd98fc988cfa6d7984c2b8601b0bb0.webm?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/3fcd98fc988cfa6d7984c2b8601b0bb0.mp4?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>UNVEIL THE GATE'S SECRET\u00a0</strong> <br>Craft new tools, upgrade your weapons, and gather the eight keys to open the gate.<br>However, be careful! Powerful foes stand in your way!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/a7e5e617c754173b9a7f30106335414b.poster.avif?t=1773881789\" width=1080 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/a7e5e617c754173b9a7f30106335414b.webm?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/a7e5e617c754173b9a7f30106335414b.mp4?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILT AROUND YOU </strong> <br>A world procedurally generated as you explore, with plenty of biomes and caves to discover!<br>It's all seamlessly blended into the physics engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/c9982ce7a0d5c448cddebac107cc59b1.poster.avif?t=1773881789\" width=1080 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/c9982ce7a0d5c448cddebac107cc59b1.webm?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/c9982ce7a0d5c448cddebac107cc59b1.mp4?t=1773881789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SHAPE\u00a0THE\u00a0WORLD</strong><br>Whether you build a castle or a roller coaster, transform your surroundings however you wish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">_________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure awaits in Mito!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680570?t=1773881789","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/fba20e253589ba84160c7281d5141f0bb5a9ab89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773881789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/bc2c490f13654d98236c225cf54e73135f8dbbee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773881789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/bc2c490f13654d98236c225cf54e73135f8dbbee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773881789","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4371250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Mito, a physics-based sandbox adventure game where you explore a procedurally generated world to gather eight keys and defeat an ancient evil. Acquire items, learn skills and prepare yourself for a historic battle. Try the demo today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/4fb91884a66ed09914011064245e4f49.poster.avif?t=1773881789\" width=1170 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/extras/4fb91884a66ed09914011064245e4f49.webm?t=17738